  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/IMG_8303.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(14 fotos) El sal&oacute; d&#39;actes de la Casa de la Cultura acull tot aquest dissabte i diumenge de mat&iacute; les jornades t&egrave;cniques &#39;Ciutats sense contaminants&#39;, organitzada per l&#39;&agrave;rea de Sostenibilitat de l&#39;Ajuntament, per iniciativa del regidor &#39;d&#39;Onda S&iacute; Se Puede&#39;, Manu Escrig Azor, que va presentar una moci&oacute; al Ple. Es va aprovar amb els tres vots d&#39;OSSP, Comprom&iacute;s y Esquerra Unida del Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave; (EUPV) i l&#39;abstenci&oacute; dels altres tres grups.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/JornadesMediAmbient.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;encontre s&#39;inscriu dins de l&#39;estrat&egrave;gia Onda Ciutat Verda 2020 i se celebraran altres cicles, segurament un altre al mar&ccedil; de 2018.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8289.jpg\" alt=\"img_8289\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8292.jpg\" alt=\"img_8292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8294.jpg\" alt=\"img_8294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8297.jpg\" alt=\"img_8297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8301.jpg\" alt=\"img_8301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8303.jpg\" alt=\"img_8303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8305.jpg\" alt=\"img_8305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8306.jpg\" alt=\"img_8306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8309.jpg\" alt=\"img_8309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8311.jpg\" alt=\"img_8311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8312.jpg\" alt=\"img_8312\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8315.jpg\" alt=\"img_8315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/img_8317.jpg\" alt=\"img_8317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesciutatssensecontaminants/jornadesmediambient.jpg\" alt=\"jornadesmediambient\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
